 #. type: Plain text
 #: ../sys-utils/hwclock.8.adoc:155
 msgid "Override *hwclock*'s default rtc device file name. Otherwise it will use the first one found in this order: _/dev/rtc_, _/dev/rtc0_, _/dev/misc/rtc_. For *IA-64:* _/dev/efirtc_ _/dev/misc/efirtc_"
